        <h1 itemprop="headline">A weight tracker without a subscription.</h1>
        <p itemprop="description">Many weight trackers have moved to monthly or yearly plans. WeekScale is built the opposite way: pay once, use it forever, and keep receiving updates. Here is how that choice works in practice.</p>
